mission "A Harbour for the Hunted"
    name "A Harbour for the Hunted"
    description "Take the pledge to Saint's Refuge and speak with the refuge council."
    source "Redoubt"
    destination "Saint's Refuge"
    reward 740
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Guns of Redoubt: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The people of Saint's Refuge have sheltered deserters from the Meridian Company and need a guarantee they will not be handed back.`
            `Several deserters are skilled gunners who know the Meridian Star. They will join the free captains if the refuge council protects their families.`
            `The council asks you to carry a written pledge from Redoubt and meet the deserters before Company patrols return.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `The council asks you to carry a written pledge from Redoubt and meet the deserters before Company patrols return.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `The militia at Redoubt signs the pledge. “A sailor who lays down his arms should have a chance to live by them again.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Harbour for the Hunted. Take the pledge to Saint's Refuge and speak with the refuge council."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The deserters share the flagship's watch schedule. Ashcombe will move at night and use the storm line to hide his approach.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Their information points to a battle east of Last Light.`
        log "Completed A Harbour for the Hunted. Received 740 gold. Their information points to a battle east of Last Light."
